# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-fermions` extends the Qiskit SDK with tools for working on fermionic systems. Within its scope it provides the following:\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-fermions` memperluas Qiskit SDK dengan alat untuk berkerja pada sistem fermionik. Dalam skopnya, ia menyediakan perkara berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Efficient data structures for the representation and manipulation of fermionic operators in different forms\n"
msgstr "Struktur data yang cekap untuk perwakilan dan manipulasi operator fermionik dalam pelbagai bentuk\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A framework for implementing operator conversion methods (including fermion-to-qubit encodings)\n"
msgstr "Rangka kerja untuk melaksanakan kaedah penukaran operator (termasuk pengekodan fermion-ke-qubit)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A library of efficient implementations of common conversion methods\n"
msgstr "Pustaka pelaksanaan cekap bagi kaedah penukaran lazim\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A framework and library of gates for expressing fermionic circuits\n"
msgstr "Rangka kerja dan pustaka get untuk menyatakan litar fermionik\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A transpilation pipeline integrated with the Qiskit transpiler process to synthesize fermionic circuits into qubit-based circuits\n"
msgstr "Saluran paip transpilasi yang disepadukan dengan proses transpiler Qiskit untuk mensintesis litar fermionik menjadi litar berasaskan qubit\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additionally, `qiskit-fermions` integrates with other tools of the ecosystem, such as:\n"
msgstr "Selain itu, `qiskit-fermions` disepadukan dengan alat-alat lain dalam ekosistem, seperti:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) for the high-level ansatz operators and efficient simulation of fermionic circuits (see [Relationship to ffsim](#relationship-to-ffsim))\n"
msgstr "[ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) untuk operator ansatz peringkat tinggi dan simulasi litar fermion yang cekap (lihat [Hubungan dengan ffsim](#relationship-to-ffsim))\n"

